# ── Unreal Engine 5 generated / transient ─────────────────────────────
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/
.vs/
.vsconfig
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/

# Compiled / generated code artifacts
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
*.dll
*.app

# Packaged / staged builds
/Packaged/
/Dist/
*.stage

# Crash dumps & profiling captures (keep these out of source control)
*.dmp
*.utrace
*.csv.profile

# ── Large binary content → use Git LFS, not raw git ───────────────────
# Track in LFS (see .gitattributes when content is added):
#   *.uasset *.umap *.wav *.fbx *.png *.tga *.exr *.mp4
# Until LFS is configured, do not commit raw binary content blobs.

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
.idea/

# ── Local-only secrets & environment (never commit) ───────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.local.ini
**/Secrets/
